    "title": "Jalen Coker questionable for Week 3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Andrew Harbaugh ,\n1 days ago Carolina Panthers WR Jalen Coker (ankle) was limited in practice on Friday, Sept. 25, and is listed as questionable for the team's Week 3 matchup with the Cleveland Browns. Why It Matters: Coker has enjoyed the resurgence of Bryce Young in 2026. If he plays in Week 3, he can be in lineups as a WR3 going against a Browns defense that has been spotty in coverage. Read full article",
